```typescript
const paymentResponse = await fetch(`${baseUrl}/payments/${encodeURIComponent(dodoPaymentIdToFetch)}`, {
  method: "GET",
  headers: {
    Authorization: `Bearer ${DODO_API_KEY}`,
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
  },
});
```
**Response**: Payment object with `status`, `payment_id`, `checkout_session_id`, `subscription_id` fields

#### Products API
**Endpoints**: 
- `POST https://[base_url]/products` — Create product (manage-dodo-product/index.ts line 194)
- `PATCH https://[base_url]/products/{product_id}` — Update product (line 267)
- `PATCH https://[base_url]/products/{product_id}` with `is_active: false` — Archive product (line 301)
- `PATCH https://[base_url]/products/{product_id}` with `is_active: true` — Restore product (line 336)

